{"id":"beats-98801d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-35fe93b4-ce7d-4889-8068-8b27aa2a017d","text":"Refactored web UI components to align with v2 data model.\n\nKey changes:\n- Replaced `KindBadge` with `LabelBadge` in `Board`, `Backlog`, `Dependencies`, and `IssueDetailModal`.\n- Labels are now styled with specific colors (blue for feature, red for bug, purple for epic).\n- Removed deprecated fields: `checklist`, `logged_effort`, and `kind`-based logic.\n- Updated `Dashboard` to remove deprecated metrics.\n- Fixed runtime error in `App.tsx` and `PendingEventsPanel.tsx` by safeguarding `pending.events` access.\n- User updated `Badge.tsx` styling directly."},"created_at":"2026-02-10T12:41:28.092925Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
