{"id":"beats-8d0a00","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9c9f7399-9fb5-4b56-8d22-e700a475c039","text":"## Implementation\n\nAdded cross-linking of issue IDs in two places:\n\n### Markdown auto-linking\n- `linkifyIssueIds()` pre-processes markdown text before rendering\n- Converts `beats-XXXXXX` patterns into markdown links: `[beats-abc123](#/issues/beats-abc123)`\n- Works in both descriptions and comments\n- Uses hash routing so clicking navigates to the issue detail\n\n### Relations sidebar\n- Issue IDs in the Relations/Dependencies section are now clickable `\u003ca\u003e` tags\n- Link to `#/issues/{id}` with hover underline\n- Click doesn't propagate to parent elements\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx` — added `linkifyIssueIds`, wrapped Markdown calls, made relation IDs into links"},"created_at":"2026-05-19T11:11:35.949215Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
