{"id":"beats-7710bb","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"Linear renders all meta as \"clickable\" tags.\n\n- hovering over a status shows a popover with a \"time in status\" info\n- clicking on a status allows to quickly change/set a new status on the issue via a popover\n- clicking on a label opens a popover that let's user select labels\n- clicking on an estimate opens a popover that let's user select an estimate the popovers are reused / same style as the ones on the issue details view.\n\nAlso, the estimate is rendered as a \"tag\" or \"badge\" with a triangle icon in front of the estimate number"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:24:46.604647Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-568255","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2fd926d7-5c9d-4151-a3c8-87ba96b8b30b","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented inline editing for description fields using a TipTap WYSIWYG markdown editor, replacing raw textareas.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **New `MarkdownEditor` component** (`web/src/components/MarkdownEditor.tsx`): Reusable TipTap-based editor with `tiptap-markdown` for proper markdown round-tripping. Supports blur-to-save, `⌘ Enter` to save, `Esc` to cancel.\n- **IssueDetail description**: Replaced textarea with `MarkdownEditor` — edit mode now renders rich text (bullets, headings, bold, etc.) matching the display mode exactly. No content shift on toggle.\n- **New issue modal**: Description field uses `MarkdownEditor` with 200px min-height for better spacing.\n- **Title inline editing**: Removed borders/backgrounds, title input now matches `\u003ch1\u003e` display style with blur-to-save.\n- **Keyboard handling**: Fixed global `keydown` handler to skip `contenteditable` elements so Escape inside the editor cancels editing instead of closing the issue.\n- **Removed dead code**: Deleted unused `IssueDetailModal.tsx`.\n- **CSS**: Added TipTap-specific styles under `prose-beats` for placeholder text and consistent first/last child margins."},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:41:54.23951Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-568255","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:42:02.559106Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
