{"id":"beats-7b9830","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"set fixed column widths for date and estimate, then the labels column (from the right for each issue row)\n\nalso: the issue id has ellipsis on longer issue IDs so maybe we need to give a bit more spa"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:43:20.40311Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-7b9830","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"set fixed column widths for date and estimate, then the labels column (from the right for each issue row)\n\n**Also**: the issue id has ellipsis on longer issue IDs so maybe we need to give a bit more space, probably that column should not be fixed but at least large enough to fit the IDs."},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:56:07.050497Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-96a6e7","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Story 1","description":"Create a shell script that allows developers on MacOS and Linux to easily set up their development environment. The script should install all necessary dependencies, tools, and libraries required for the project.\n\n## Requirements:\n\n- Script must work on both MacOS and Linux\n- Should be idempotent (can be run multiple times safely)\n- Should include clear instructions and documentation\n- Must handle common issues gracefully\n\n## Required specifications:\n\n- NodeJS LTS 24.14\n- Ruby 3.4.8 via rbenv\n- Python 3.11 via uv\n- Git 2.53\n\n## The script should:\n\n1. Detect the operating system and install appropriate packages\n2. Install Node.js LTS 24.14\n3. Install Ruby 3.4.8 using rbenv\n4. Install Python 3.11 using uv\n5. Install Git 2.53\n6. Handle errors gracefully with clear error messages\n7. Be idempotent (safe to run multiple times)\n8. Include documentation and usage instructions\n\n## Acceptance criteria:\n\n- Script works on both MacOS and Linux\n- Script is idempotent\n- All specified versions are installed correctly\n- Script handles common issues gracefully\n- Clear documentation is included\n\nHere is the example trace:\n\n```\nExecution ran into a timeout:\n```\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869300866,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.start\",\"iter\":6,\"ctx\":10,\"msg\":\"think.start\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869301977,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"tool.request\",\"tool\":\"manage_update_task\",\"msg\":\"tool.request\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869302552,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"tool-executor\",\"tool\":\"manage_update_task\",\"msg\":\"Tool executing\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869302598,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"tool-executor\",\"action\":\"tool.call\",\"name\":\"manage_update_task\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"dur\":47,\"msg\":\"tool.call\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869302612,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.complete\",\"tokens\":51,\"toolCalls\":1,\"tools\":[\"manage_update_task\"],\"ctx\":10,\"msg\":\"think.complete\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869302622,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.start\",\"iter\":7,\"ctx\":10,\"msg\":\"think.start\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869303789,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"main\",\"action\":\"task.available\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"title\":\"Create dev environment setup script for MacOS and Linux\",\"msg\":\"task.available\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869303840,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.resume\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"reason\":\"notes_found\",\"noteKeys\":[\"progress\"],\"msg\":\"task.resume\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869303842,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.executing\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"msg\":\"task.executing\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869303858,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.analysis.start\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"msg\":\"task.analysis.start\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869303861,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.start\",\"iter\":1,\"ctx\":9,\"msg\":\"think.start\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869309892,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"tool.request\",\"tool\":\"run_command\",\"msg\":\"tool.request\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869310532,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"tool-executor\",\"tool\":\"run_command\",\"msg\":\"Tool executing\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869310538,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"tool-executor\",\"action\":\"tool.call\",\"name\":\"run_command\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"dur\":6,\"detail\":\"echo \\\"Triage complete\\\"\",\"msg\":\"tool.call\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869310570,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.complete\",\"tokens\":134,\"toolCalls\":1,\"tools\":[\"run_command\"],\"ctx\":11,\"msg\":\"think.complete\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869310570,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.start\",\"iter\":8,\"ctx\":11,\"msg\":\"think.start\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869317719,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.complete\",\"tokens\":185,\"ctx\":11,\"msg\":\"think.complete\"}\nlouis-1      | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869317756,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"fd1ff3b2097f\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.complete\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"msg\":\"task.complete\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869320068,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.complete\",\"tokens\":483,\"ctx\":10,\"msg\":\"think.complete\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869320068,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.analysis.done\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"result\":\"completed\",\"hasAnalysis\":true,\"msg\":\"task.analysis.done\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869320068,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.plan.start\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"msg\":\"task.plan.start\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869327956,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.plan.done\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"steps\":4,\"msg\":\"task.plan.done\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869327958,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.step.start\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"step\":1,\"total\":4,\"description\":\"Step 1: Create the main setup.sh script with OS detection, package manager detection, and script structure including shebang, error handling setup, and function definitions\",\"msg\":\"task.step.start\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869327959,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"think.start\",\"iter\":1,\"ctx\":9,\"msg\":\"think.start\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869335568,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"tool.request\",\"tool\":\"write_file\",\"msg\":\"tool.request\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":50,\"time\":1772869580748,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"llm.error\",\"error\":\"The operation timed out.\",\"phase\":\"executing\",\"msg\":\"llm.error\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":50,\"time\":1772869580749,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"error\":\"The operation timed out.\",\"phase\":\"executing\",\"msg\":\"Unhandled phase error\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":30,\"time\":1772869580750,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"phase\":\"escalating\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"msg\":\"Phase started\"}\nlightning-1  | {\"level\":40,\"time\":1772869580750,\"pid\":1,\"hostname\":\"3194584b40cc\",\"module\":\"kernel\",\"action\":\"task.escalated\",\"id\":\"task_oaqtdlj0xh\",\"reason\":\"Kernel error: The operation timed out.\",\"msg\":\"task.escalated\"}\n```\n```","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:57:21.934492Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-96a6e7","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"Create a shell script that allows developers on MacOS and Linux to easily set up their development environment. The script should install all necessary dependencies, tools, and libraries required for the project.\n\n## Requirements:\n\n- Script must work on both MacOS and Linux\n- Should be idempotent (can be run multiple times safely)\n- Should include clear instructions and documentation\n- Must handle common issues gracefully\n\n## Required specifications:\n\n- NodeJS LTS 24.14\n- Ruby 3.4.8 via rbenv\n- Python 3.11 via uv\n- Git 2.53\n\n## The script should:\n\n1. Detect the operating system and install appropriate packages\n2. Install Node.js LTS 24.14\n3. Install Ruby 3.4.8 using rbenv\n4. Install Python 3.11 using uv\n5. Install Git 2.53\n6. Handle errors gracefully with clear error messages\n7. Be idempotent (safe to run multiple times)\n8. Include documentation and usage instructions\n\n## Acceptance criteria:\n\n- Script works on both MacOS and Linux\n- Script is idempotent\n- All specified versions are installed correctly\n- Script handles common issues gracefully\n- Clear documentation is included\n\nHere is the example trace:\n\n```\nfoo test 123\n```"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T10:00:39.028788Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
