{"id":"beats-237dd6","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Promote the Dashboard view from secondary nav to **first primary nav entry** and make it the default entry point when no hash route is set.\n\n## Sidebar\n- Move `dashboard` from `SECONDARY_NAV` to `PRIMARY_NAV`, position **first** (above Issues).\n- Rename label from `Analytics` to `Dashboard` for clarity.\n\n## Default route\n- Update `parseHash` fallback from `'backlog'` to `'dashboard'` so opening the app with no hash lands on the dashboard.\n\n## Layout\n- Center the dashboard content (`mx-auto` on the inner `max-w-5xl` container) so it doesn't hug the left edge of a wide screen.\n- Audit card spacing/visual hierarchy as we add more sections (groundwork for [[beats-49c21a]] and future dashboard cards).","labels":["feature"],"title":"Dashboard layout: first nav entry, default view, centered cards"},"created_at":"2026-05-26T09:44:44.705351775Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
